 "nodes": {
  "-1109375070": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s a beautiful day, isn’t it? You don’t come to the beach often enough, {M}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1371620696": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Katarina",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Beautiful? Hardly. All I see is sand, sunburnt skin, and… peasants.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "144544733": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "You’re impossible, you know that? Try to relax a bit.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1961437082": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Katarina",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Relax? Among them? This entire place reeks of desperation. People squabbling over cheap trinkets and burning themselves like common livestock.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1200622906": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "They’re just enjoying themselves. Not everyone can afford a private island getaway.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-212044957": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Katarina",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "And that’s exactly why we shouldn’t be here. Mixing with the rabble… It’s beneath us, Emma. Your {F} would have never—",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2000233617": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Enough. He’s not here, and I’m not him. We came here to get away from all of that. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1626466461": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You’re always talking about how much stress you’re under. Well, this is your chance to let go for once.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "172506908": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Katarina",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Let go… I suppose I could try. But if one more brat splashes sand on me, I’m ordering security to clear this beach.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1896362714": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Emma",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I’ll keep that in mind. Come on, I’ll get us some drinks.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-969449686": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Katarina",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Just make sure they have something decent—no cheap cocktails from a plastic cup. And don’t take too long, I feel like I’m on display here.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
